WEBVTT

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:36.910 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:39.920 line:0%
[Episode 12]

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.890 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:01:40.839 --> 00:01:42.800 line:0%
Princess Ying is here!

00:01:44.839 --> 00:01:45.640 line:0%
Mother.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:49.839 line:0%
Mother.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.400 line:0%
I want to accuse Prime Minister Zhang Xingwei

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.420 line:0%
of using his authority over the Hongwen Academy examinations

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.809 line:0%
to win over scholars from humble backgrounds.

00:01:55.809 --> 00:01:58.059 line:0%
When his attempts failed, he resorted to silencing them through murder.

00:01:58.059 --> 00:01:58.779 line:0%
Today,

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.060 line:0%
many scholars from humble backgrounds have gone missing.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:03.800 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.000 line:0%
I have been wrongly accused!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.040 line:0%
I only sought to show compassion for the scholars

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.680 line:0%
from humble backgrounds given their long journeys,

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.400 line:0%
fearing they might not be well cared for before the exams.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.880 line:0%
So I instructed the young men from noble families

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.120 line:0%
to treat them kindly.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.040 line:0%
How can such slander

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.200 line:0%
be cast upon me?

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.120 line:0%
Then tell me,

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:18.400 line:0%
where are those scholars

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.200 line:0%
from humble backgrounds

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.850 line:0%
who left the banquet early?

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.560 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:29.740 line:0%
in my opinion,

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.520 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang is the head of civil officials

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:32.990 line:0%
and has always valued talent.

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:34.840 line:0%
Winning over scholars sounds believable,

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.600 line:0%
but as for silencing them through murder,

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.500 line:0%
I'm afraid

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.190 line:0%
that's beyond the capability of one person.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.140 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.810 line:0%
what do you mean by that?

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.440 line:0%
Stop talking nonsense!

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:47.600 line:0%
Yong'an,

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:49.360 line:0%
this matter is of great importance.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:51.040 line:0%
It should not be discussed recklessly.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:52.440 line:0%
Do you have any evidence?

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:53.440 line:0%
I...

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.240 line:0%
I have.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.710 line:0%
Last night, a few scholars from humble backgrounds were attacked.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:10.130 line:0%
They were eventually rescued by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.260 line:0%
These are the weapons we intercepted.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:13.560 line:0%
They all...

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:25.240 line:0%
bear the markings of Prince Xian's Mansion.

00:03:28.129 --> 00:03:29.150 line:0%
Mother,

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.040 line:0%
I absolutely

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.120 line:0%
have nothing to do with this.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:32.360 line:0%
Please investigate thoroughly.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.110 line:0%
The assassins all confessed before they died

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:36.140 line:0%
that they were sent by Prince Xian.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:41.420 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:42.100 line:0%
don't...

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.490 line:0%
don't slander him!

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.280 line:0%
I

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.440 line:0%
wonder when you

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:48.400 line:0%
sided with Princess Ying.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.200 line:0%
Minister Zhang, stop your sophistry.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.000 line:0%
With both witnesses and evidence present,

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.120 line:0%
how can you and Prince Xian

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.080 line:0%
continue to oversee

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.200 line:0%
the Hongwen Academy examinations?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:57.640 line:0%
Admit your guilt.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:00.040 line:0%
The perpetrator must indeed face justice,

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.000 line:0%
but it's not Minister Zhang or Prince Xian.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.420 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.610 line:0%
you rescued them

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.520 line:0%
and brought the evidence.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.070 line:0%
How come now you're saying

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.010 line:0%
the mastermind is someone else?

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:17.079 line:0%
There were three groups of attackers.

00:04:17.079 --> 00:04:19.560 line:0%
The first group aimed only to kidnap and intimidate,

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.280 line:0%
likely to assert dominance

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.560 line:0%
over the scholars from humble backgrounds.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:23.400 line:0%
Those people

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.260 line:0%
were Minister Zhang's subordinates.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.400 line:0%
I...

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.020 line:0%
The second group was ruthless,

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:30.800 line:0%
using weapons

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.459 line:0%
with markings of Prince Xian's Mansion.

00:04:32.459 --> 00:04:33.890 line:0%
They also constantly mentioned Prince Xian,

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:34.850 line:0%
as if they wanted

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.700 line:0%
others to know they were his men.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:37.920 line:0%
Who are you people?

00:04:37.959 --> 00:04:39.280 line:0%
Prince Xian is wise.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.720 line:0%
You poor scholars won't yield

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.100 line:0%
to threats or bribes.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.660 line:0%
It's better to kill you all!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.840 line:0%
The third group,

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:46.760 line:0%
lying in ambush,

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.800 line:0%
used vicious methods solely to silence witnesses.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:49.760 line:0%
They even deliberately used

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.890 line:0%
secret weapons with markings of Prince Xian's Mansion.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.080 line:0%
How could this be?

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.680 line:0%
If Prince Xian is truly the mastermind,

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.420 line:0%
why would he make it so obvious?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:05.460 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.490 line:0%
isn't that contradictory?

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.840 line:0%
Looks like there's more than

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:16.960 line:0%
one party out there

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.440 line:0%
eager to convict me,

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:20.200 line:0%
Mother.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:25.130 line:0%
Please investigate thoroughly.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.370 line:0%
Since the evidence is questionable,

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:29.740 line:0%
then...

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:34.410 line:0%
let the Imperial Security Bureau continue the investigation.

00:05:35.959 --> 00:05:37.600 line:0%
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.840 line:0%
This time, thanks to Mr. Shen,

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.760 line:0%
the scholars from humble backgrounds were saved

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.000 line:0%
from danger.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.720 line:0%
From now on, we must

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.720 line:0%
ensure no further incidents occur.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:57.880 line:0%
Prince Xian,

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.110 line:0%
Minister Zhang,

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.960 line:0%
the safety of the scholars from humble backgrounds

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.560 line:0%
is now your responsibility.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.030 line:0%
If anything else happens,

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.960 line:0%
you will be held accountable.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.160 line:0%
Yes, Mother.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.240 line:0%
Please rest assured, Your Majesty.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.200 line:0%
Even if it costs me my life,

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:15.160 line:0%
I will ensure the safety of all the scholars.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:26.520 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.410 line:0%
Thank you for today, Grand Commander.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.360 line:0%
I merely carried out my duties

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.400 line:0%
impartially.

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.040 line:0%
Minister Zhang, you don't need to thank me.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:40.970 line:0%
Minister Zhang!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.680 line:0%
Minister Zhang, why bother with this?

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:48.480 line:0%
He...

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.480 line:0%
just wanted

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.880 line:0%
to show off in front

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:52.560 line:0%
of the grand empress dowager.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:55.840 line:0%
Of course, Lord Lai,

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.770 line:0%
you are more discreet and low-key.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.810 line:0%
But be careful. Always lurking in the shadows

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.290 line:0%
might get yourself trapped in your own web.

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.390 line:0%
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.530 line:0%
This meal has to be on Xing.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:32.680 line:0%
Let me tell you guys

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.140 line:0%
something you don't know.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.050 line:0%
Today, when Director Wu

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:38.120 line:0%
heard Xing has been granted

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.400 line:0%
the authority to investigate Chen Huo'e's case,

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.080 line:0%
his face

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.080 line:0%
turned even darker than a pig's liver.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.890 line:0%
You know what? Director Wu

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.360 line:0%
even told us not to sit

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.500 line:0%
with Xing.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:50.920 line:0%
He might control me in the Ministry of Justice,

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.400 line:0%
but he can't control

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.890 line:0%
who I drink with.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:53.800 line:0%
Xing.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:54.800 line:0%
If you need any help

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.360 line:0%
from constables to solve this case,

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.320 line:0%
feel free to ask me anytime.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:58.120 line:0%
Come on.

00:07:58.209 --> 00:07:59.510 line:0%
A toast to you.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.370 line:0%
Me too.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:02.650 line:0%
Me too.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.640 line:0%
Come on. Together.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:05.760 line:0%
Come on.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.200 line:0%
Right, Xing,

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.000 line:0%
I want to ask you about something.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.190 line:0%
Do you know if there's any way...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.520 line:0%
that can remove a birthmark?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.640 line:0%
A birthmark?

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.880 line:0%
How come I didn't know you have a birthmark?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.400 line:0%
A...

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.140 line:0%
A... A friend of mine

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.000 line:0%
asked me about ways

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.440 line:0%
to remove a birthmark.

00:08:33.589 --> 00:08:34.880 line:0%
I've been flipping through medical books lately

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:35.969 line:0%
but haven't found anything.

00:08:35.969 --> 00:08:37.709 line:0%
That's why I'm asking you.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.000 line:0%
Birthmarks are congenital.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:43.760 line:0%
If it's not a medical condition,

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:46.360 line:0%
it's difficult to remove them with just herbs.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.360 line:0%
I heard from my friends in the martial arts world

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.120 line:0%
about a method

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.380 line:0%
to remove birthmarks.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.000 line:0%
What is it, Commander Xu?

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.640 line:0%
This method sounds a bit strange.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.760 line:0%
You take a pure gold ring

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.180 line:0%
and repeatedly rub it over the birthmark.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.400 line:0%
That's simple.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.320 line:0%
I have plenty of gold.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.440 line:0%
Thank you, Commander Xu.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.200 line:0%
No big deal.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.080 line:0%
Waiter!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.080 line:0%
Waiter!

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.000 line:0%
No one is answering. I'm going.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.930 line:0%
Waiter! Get me another pot of wine!

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.690 line:0%
Has Chuichui...

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.400 line:0%
made any new friend

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.840 line:0%
with a birthmark lately?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:27.880 line:0%
Xing!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.230 line:0%
Xing.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.480 line:0%
Listen,

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.840 line:0%
there are some drunk guys over there.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.520 line:0%
One of them

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:34.800 line:0%
is quite good-looking.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.320 line:0%
He went to the Ministry of Justice looking for you a few days ago.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.180 line:0%
Looking for me?

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.360 line:0%
This one, this one.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.040 line:0%
This one.

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.400 line:0%
The one in the middle.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:46.760 line:0%
Pan?

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:48.920 line:0%
Pan.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:52.520 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.880 line:0%
the Hongwen Academy's exam is approaching.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:55.840 line:0%
Didn't you say

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.480 line:0%
you wanted to bring honor to scholars from humble backgrounds?

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.240 line:0%
Why are you here drowning your sorrows

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.810 line:0%
instead of focusing on preparing for the exam?

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.790 line:0%
No regard for family backgrounds?

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:07.770 line:0%
Clearly, human efforts can't overcome fate.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.110 line:0%
They all have the markings of Prince Xian's Mansion?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:17.200 line:0%
Prince Xian sent three groups of people

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.080 line:0%
to deal with us,

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.080 line:0%
scholars from humble backgrounds?

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.970 line:0%
This is just the beginning.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.440 line:0%
This exam

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.880 line:0%
is not as simple as you think.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.280 line:0%
I advise you

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.220 line:0%
not to dream of playing up to persons in power.

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:33.010 line:0%
The waters of Xiang'an City

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.080 line:0%
are too deep for you to wade into.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.590 line:0%
It's you,

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.080 line:0%
the corrupt power-seekers,

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:39.960 line:0%
who have muddied the waters

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:40.960 line:0%
of Xiang'an City.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.800 line:0%
Is it wrong to seek power and profit?

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:47.910 line:0%
The problem isn't power itself.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:51.170 line:0%
It's how power is used.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.050 line:0%
With power,

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.280 line:0%
one can protect those they care about

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.670 line:0%
and do what they believe is right.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.660 line:0%
What good

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.940 line:0%
is self-righteousness and empty pride?

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:13.520 line:0%
Besides venting through words,

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.400 line:0%
what great things can they accomplish?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.160 line:0%
If you have this much energy,

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:21.400 line:0%
why don't you use it

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.920 line:0%
where it truly matters?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.040 line:0%
It's better to drink.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.320 line:0%
It's better to drink.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:58.100 line:0%
[Guangyue Restaurant]

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.240 line:0%
Please take them back to the Ghost Market.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.180 line:0%
Thank you.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.520 line:0%
Miss Yan!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.900 line:0%
Enjoy life to the fullest.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:06.970 line:0%
Don't stop drinking.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:08.360 line:0%
Don't stop drinking.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.600 line:0%
Be careful.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.880 line:0%
The exam is coming up soon.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:18.560 line:0%
Why do they look like

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:21.020 line:0%
they're drowning their sorrows in alcohol?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.360 line:0%
Don't you know, Xing?

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.000 line:0%
Last night, three groups of attackers

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.840 line:0%
attempted to kill the scholars from humble backgrounds.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.000 line:0%
Really?

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:27.760 line:0%
Yes.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.480 line:0%
How are the scholars now?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.280 line:0%
Didn't Grand Commander Shen tell you?

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:32.760 line:0%
He single-handedly turned the tide

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.640 line:0%
and saved them.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.020 line:0%
Otherwise, it would have been a disaster.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.640 line:0%
Shen Du saved them?

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.270 line:0%
[Chi]

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.590 line:0%
Help me deliver this letter to the Ministry of Justice.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:58.510 line:0%
Thank you.

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.330 line:0%
[Xiang'an City]

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:06.840 line:0%
[Xiang'an City]

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:09.740 line:0%
Madam.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.000 line:0%
I'm looking for

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.040 line:0%
Miss Yan, a female official at the Ministry of Justice.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:14.800 line:0%
She's not here.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:17.040 line:0%
I think she's out investigating a case with the White Ghost.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:17.970 line:0%
The White Ghost?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:22.100 line:0%
Shen Du, Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:25.110 line:0%
He is Xing's husband.

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:27.720 line:0%
Husband?

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.210 line:0%
I heard the grand commander's wife

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:30.540 line:0%
got beaten again today.

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.570 line:0%
She was limping when she left the mansion.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:33.420 line:0%
Yes.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:34.560 line:0%
And her forehead

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:35.800 line:0%
was badly swollen.

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:37.920 line:0%
She married the White Ghost,

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.100 line:0%
so don't expect anything good to come of it.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.040 line:0%
Xing.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.830 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.080 line:0%
You and I have been writing letters to each other for a long time.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.410 line:0%
I heard you got married,

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:44.820 line:0%
and I shouldn't disturb you anymore.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.750 line:0%
But how can I not worry,

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:47.600 line:0%
knowing that you married

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:49.360 line:0%
that notorious White Ghost?

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.000 line:0%
Madam.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:13.880 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.000 line:0%
Madam.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.120 line:0%
What happened?

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.720 line:0%
Since Grand Commander came back,

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.600 line:0%
he has been practicing martial arts in the backyard.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.600 line:0%
He hasn't even had dinner yet.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:25.840 line:0%
Madam, you're finally back.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.840 line:0%
Please go to the backyard now.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:27.640 line:0%
During the past few days,

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:28.760 line:0%
Grand Commander has been in the mansion every day,

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.020 line:0%
preparing tea and snacks to wait for you.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.640 line:0%
But you went out either to solve cases

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.480 line:0%
or to drink with those

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:34.410 line:0%
unimportant people on the street.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:38.200 line:0%
Tonight, Grand Commander has been waiting for you

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.280 line:0%
in the mansion for hours again.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.080 line:0%
So...

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.710 line:0%
He's been waiting for me?

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.200 line:0%
I thought

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.600 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau was busy investigating cases.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:55.980 line:0%
You can serve the dishes now.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:07.910 line:0%
Nice punch!

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.000 line:0%
So, you finally decided to come back?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.240 line:0%
Me?

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.540 line:0%
During the past few days, I went to report in the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:30.360 line:0%
I also went to inspect

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.440 line:0%
Chen Shoujie's mansion.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.600 line:0%
Then I went with Chuichui and Xu

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:33.600 line:0%
to drink wine.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.630 line:0%
I also ran into Pan, an itinerant merchant.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:39.630 line:0%
That's why I came back a bit late.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:44.270 line:0%
Do you... need something from me?

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.240 line:0%
I'm hungry.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.150 line:0%
If you're hungry, go eat.

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:56.280 line:0%
By the way,

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.000 line:0%
I came back to tell you

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:58.960 line:0%
I promised my mother

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.260 line:0%
I'll go back to Yan's Mansion tonight.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.420 line:0%
You go have dinner.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.110 line:0%
I'm leaving.

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:02.750 line:0%
You...

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.370 line:0%
Dinner is ready.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.410 line:0%
Forget dinner.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.120 line:0%
Without me, this family will fall apart sooner or later.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.500 line:0%
Uncle Zhong, you go first.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.960 line:0%
Grand Commander and I will be there shortly.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.480 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.320 line:0%
Madam is not some

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:21.920 line:0%
illiterate countrywoman.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:22.440 line:0%
She is

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.520 line:0%
a scribe at the Ministry of Justice.

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:24.680 line:0%
She holds public office.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:26.360 line:0%
Her daytime work is serious business,

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.000 line:0%
and having a drink with colleagues

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.080 line:0%
in the evening is nothing unusual.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:28.560 line:0%
If anything,

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.820 line:0%
you're the one making a big deal out of it.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.890 line:0%
So, my point is...

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:37.760 line:0%
you can take this opportunity...

00:17:09.149 --> 00:17:09.720 line:0%
Mother,

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.440 line:0%
I really can't drink anymore.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:15.149 line:0%
This is the best tonic

00:17:15.149 --> 00:17:16.360 line:0%
I picked and

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:17.629 line:0%
specially made for you.

00:17:17.629 --> 00:17:19.800 line:0%
It's a pity your husband didn't come back.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.909 line:0%
Or I'd have you both drink it.

00:17:21.909 --> 00:17:23.720 line:0%
I guarantee you'd have two children in three years.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:24.080 line:0%
Mother,

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.869 line:0%
what are you thinking about?

00:17:26.629 --> 00:17:27.629 line:0%
You didn't put anything strange

00:17:27.629 --> 00:17:28.480 line:0%
in this, did you?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.320 line:0%
No, I didn't.

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:31.800 line:0%
I wish I could,

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.480 line:0%
but unfortunately, I don't have Chen Huo'e's

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:34.760 line:0%
legendary skills.

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.160 line:0%
Otherwise, I'd get you some

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.040 line:0%
elixir for immortality

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.320 line:0%
or resurrection.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.760 line:0%
Mother, what are you talking about?

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:43.620 line:0%
How did you know about Chen Huo'e?

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.120 line:0%
Seriously?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:46.840 line:0%
Is there anyone in Xiang'an

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.940 line:0%
who doesn't know about her now?

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:50.680 line:0%
Five years ago,

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.200 line:0%
Chen Huo'e, who committed suicide in public,

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.680 line:0%
came back to life,

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.080 line:0%
reborn like a phoenix.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:57.880 line:0%
She fought her way back

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.920 line:0%
from the underworld,

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.340 line:0%
overcoming all obstacles.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:02.600 line:0%
What she was capable of

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.400 line:0%
was extraordinary.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.680 line:0%
Mother, where did you hear

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.200 line:0%
all this nonsense?

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.600 line:0%
I heard it from

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:11.640 line:0%
First Madam.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.040 line:0%
If you don't believe me,

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.240 line:0%
you surely believe First Madam, right?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.960 line:0%
All the noble ladies in Xiang'an are talking about this.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.080 line:0%
Chen Huo'e

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:22.740 line:0%
had the power to break through the gates of hell.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.000 line:0%
Even the ghost envoys

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.800 line:0%
were powerless against her.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:35.960 line:0%
Mother, you smell so nice.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.560 line:0%
What rouge did you use today?

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.420 line:0%
You want to know?

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.480 line:0%
I'll give you some.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.730 line:0%
But you need to drink a bit more.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:58.770 line:0%
Xing,

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.600 line:0%
I heard it was thanks to you

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:03.600 line:0%
that Caiwei and the others were able to return safely.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.060 line:0%
You don't come back often,

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.440 line:0%
so your father specially asked the cooks

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.000 line:0%
to prepare some midnight snacks.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.120 line:0%
Eat more.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.370 line:0%
Eat more.

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.480 line:0%
Xing,

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.600 line:0%
there are many rumors outside about you

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.120 line:0%
and the grand commander.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:19.080 line:0%
If you've really been wronged,

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.040 line:0%
you must tell us.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.420 line:0%
Yes.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.080 line:0%
Grand Commander is here!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.940 line:0%
Who is he going to arrest this time?

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.020 line:0%
Grand Commander, this way, please.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:30.310 line:0%
Hurry!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.030 line:0%
Hurry!

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.520 line:0%
Go hide in the back room!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.120 line:0%
Hurry!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:33.730 line:0%
Hurry!

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.680 line:0%
Don't act like you're facing the King of Hell.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:37.560 line:0%
The grand commander doesn't eat people.

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.360 line:0%
Mojie,

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:39.360 line:0%
you were taken away

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.040 line:0%
by the White Ghost last time.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:42.760 line:0%
It seems you've become a different person since you came back.

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:44.280 line:0%
Why are you suddenly speaking up for him?

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.280 line:0%
Of course.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.630 line:0%
I am now...

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:47.640 line:0%
I am...

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.200 line:0%
I can't tell you.

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:55.800 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:22.440 line:0%
It seems I came at the right time.

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:25.880 line:0%
I can join my wife

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:27.040 line:0%
and the family

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.640 line:0%
for midnight snacks.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.800 line:0%
Why did you come today?

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.160 line:0%
Grand Commander, please take the seat of honor.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:52.890 line:0%
Honey, you were not home,

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.000 line:0%
so I couldn't enjoy my meal.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:23.160 line:0%
Father.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:23.900 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.500 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:34.960 line:0%
Honey.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.400 line:0%
Here.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:49.960 line:0%
Thank you.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:03.500 line:0%
That's enough.

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:04.360 line:0%
That's enough.

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:27.280 line:0%
Here.

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:43.100 line:0%
Take your time eating, Honey.

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:44.080 line:0%
It may not be

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:45.740 line:0%
as delicious as what you make,

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:48.080 line:0%
but it tastes like home.

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:55.600 line:0%
Don't just stand there.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:56.800 line:0%
Sit down and eat together.

00:22:56.800 --> 00:22:57.600 line:0%
Okay.

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:05.560 line:0%
Today, I still want

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:07.040 line:0%
to chat with my sister.

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:08.330 line:0%
Honey, why don't you

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:09.820 line:0%
go back first?

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:19.600 line:0%
Sure.

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:22.900 line:0%
Take your time chatting.

00:23:23.400 --> 00:23:24.400 line:0%
I'll wait for you.

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:25.920 line:0%
No rush.

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:33.140 line:0%
Shen Du, what exactly do you want?

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:44.040 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.320 line:0%
the information I provided recently

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:46.760 line:0%
was timely enough, right?

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:47.960 line:0%
When I saw those

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:50.080 line:0%
scholars from humble backgrounds being ungrateful,

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:50.920 line:0%
I knew

00:23:50.920 --> 00:23:53.650 line:0%
Minister Zhang would definitely deal with them.

00:23:53.960 --> 00:23:55.690 line:0%
You're indeed Xing's brother.

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:58.700 line:0%
You're quite clever.

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:02.260 line:0%
Thank... Thank you, Grand Commander.

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:07.240 line:0%
Once I pass this exam,

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:09.880 line:0%
I hope you, my brother-in-law, can promote...

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:11.980 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:24:11.980 --> 00:24:13.860 line:0%
my son was just talking nonsense.

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:16.380 line:0%
Grand Commander, please don't take it to heart.

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:18.190 line:0%
Please don't take it to heart.

00:24:33.080 --> 00:24:35.480 line:0%
It really was him who saved those scholars.

00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:38.480 line:0%
Please come in, Grand Commander.

00:24:38.480 --> 00:24:39.960 line:0%
Since we have some free time,

00:24:39.960 --> 00:24:41.740 line:0%
I'd like to invite you

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:43.790 line:0%
to take a look at my paintings.

00:24:44.860 --> 00:24:45.800 line:0%
Dr. Yan, I've long heard

00:24:45.800 --> 00:24:47.880 line:0%
you're a renowned calligrapher and painter of our dynasty.

00:24:47.880 --> 00:24:49.240 line:0%
It's truly a pleasure

00:24:49.260 --> 00:24:50.710 line:0%
to see your works today.

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:03.360 line:0%
I didn't expect Yan's Mansion

00:25:03.360 --> 00:25:04.120 line:0%
to have collected

00:25:04.120 --> 00:25:06.520 line:0%
so many paintings and calligraphy pieces.

00:25:07.080 --> 00:25:08.610 line:0%
This calligraphy piece...

00:25:09.910 --> 00:25:12.310 line:0%
Isn't the original in the imperial palace?

00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:14.820 line:0%
I never thought

00:25:14.960 --> 00:25:15.800 line:0%
that I couldn't hide it

00:25:15.800 --> 00:25:17.520 line:0%
from you, Grand Commander.

00:25:17.830 --> 00:25:19.490 line:0%
The original calligraphy piece

00:25:19.490 --> 00:25:21.040 line:0%
is indeed in the imperial palace.

00:25:21.040 --> 00:25:21.760 line:0%
This one

00:25:21.760 --> 00:25:22.720 line:0%
is merely

00:25:22.720 --> 00:25:24.420 line:0%
my imitation.

00:25:24.640 --> 00:25:25.600 line:0%
To be honest,

00:25:25.600 --> 00:25:26.600 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:25:26.840 --> 00:25:28.910 line:0%
all these masterpieces in this room

00:25:28.940 --> 00:25:31.480 line:0%
are just my replicas.

00:25:33.360 --> 00:25:35.490 line:0%
They look as genuine as the originals.

00:25:38.470 --> 00:25:40.200 line:0%
Dr. Yan, I didn't expect

00:25:40.520 --> 00:25:42.320 line:0%
that your ability to imitate the works

00:25:42.320 --> 00:25:44.520 line:0%
of famous masters is truly remarkable.

00:25:45.560 --> 00:25:47.420 line:0%
Grand Commander, I'm flattered.

00:25:47.720 --> 00:25:50.040 line:0%
I have no other talents,

00:25:50.440 --> 00:25:52.640 line:0%
but in the art of imitation,

00:25:52.920 --> 00:25:55.570 line:0%
I can claim some skills.

00:25:59.400 --> 00:26:01.720 line:0%
Honey, I heard from Madam that you and...

00:26:02.160 --> 00:26:03.240 line:0%
and Grand Commander

00:26:03.240 --> 00:26:04.640 line:0%
are enjoying paintings and calligraphy pieces together.

00:26:04.640 --> 00:26:07.180 line:0%
It occurred to me that you once imitated

00:26:07.480 --> 00:26:09.570 line:0%
Lord Shen's manuscripts,

00:26:09.920 --> 00:26:11.960 line:0%
so I specially found them for you.

00:26:13.220 --> 00:26:14.530 line:0%
[Old age approaches step by step, yet I fear my virtuous name remains unfulfilled.]

00:26:22.430 --> 00:26:23.330 line:0%
My father's?

00:26:29.130 --> 00:26:30.940 line:0%
Please forgive me, Grand Commander.

00:26:30.940 --> 00:26:31.980 line:0%
I...

00:26:32.050 --> 00:26:34.090 line:0%
I had no ulterior motive.

00:26:34.580 --> 00:26:35.920 line:0%
It's just that...

00:26:51.720 --> 00:26:53.840 line:0%
[Old age approaches step by step, yet I fear my virtuous name remains unfulfilled.]

00:26:55.560 --> 00:26:56.360 line:0%
It's alright.

00:27:01.570 --> 00:27:03.570 line:0%
My father was a disgraced official.

00:27:04.800 --> 00:27:07.660 line:0%
So naturally, few would want to associate with him.

00:27:14.220 --> 00:27:14.600 line:0%
[Old age approaches step by step, yet I fear my virtuous name remains unfulfilled.]

00:27:28.760 --> 00:27:29.560 line:0%
Actually,

00:27:30.240 --> 00:27:31.530 line:0%
I indeed studied

00:27:31.590 --> 00:27:33.680 line:0%
Lord Shen's calligraphy styles carefully

00:27:33.680 --> 00:27:35.320 line:0%
back then.

00:27:35.770 --> 00:27:37.670 line:0%
When Lord Shen was young,

00:27:37.840 --> 00:27:39.210 line:0%
his brushstrokes were sharp as swords,

00:27:39.210 --> 00:27:40.930 line:0%
bold and majestic.

00:27:41.020 --> 00:27:42.430 line:0%
But later,

00:27:42.460 --> 00:27:44.960 line:0%
his style became more restrained,

00:27:44.990 --> 00:27:46.520 line:0%
simple, and rounded.

00:27:46.550 --> 00:27:49.260 line:0%
It took me a long time

00:27:49.280 --> 00:27:50.280 line:0%
to replicate

00:27:50.310 --> 00:27:52.680 line:0%
his handwriting so accurately.

00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:58.030 line:0%
[The sun and moon fleetingly pass, unceasing; spring and autumn cycle through their appointed turns.]

00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:05.430 line:0%
Could it be...

00:28:23.900 --> 00:28:24.840 line:0%
It's been a long time since I saw

00:28:24.840 --> 00:28:25.600 line:0%
handwriting

00:28:25.600 --> 00:28:27.730 line:0%
so strikingly similar to my father's.

00:28:28.200 --> 00:28:30.130 line:0%
I was momentarily lost in thought.

00:28:30.210 --> 00:28:31.010 line:0%
I apologize.

00:28:31.040 --> 00:28:32.490 line:0%
Not at all.

00:28:34.360 --> 00:28:36.480 line:0%
I still have things to handle in the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:37.280 line:0%
Goodbye.

00:28:37.960 --> 00:28:38.760 line:0%
Okay.

00:28:39.680 --> 00:28:41.280 line:0%
Grand Commander, you're indeed quite busy.

00:28:41.280 --> 00:28:42.480 line:0%
No need to walk me out.

00:28:43.280 --> 00:28:44.880 line:0%
Take care, Grand Commander.

00:28:56.220 --> 00:28:57.640 line:0%
I can't believe you.

00:28:57.670 --> 00:28:58.880 line:0%
Minister Zhang said

00:28:58.900 --> 00:29:00.880 line:0%
Shen Du was only removed from the criminal registry

00:29:00.880 --> 00:29:02.000 line:0%
by taking the blame for his father.

00:29:02.000 --> 00:29:03.120 line:0%
Why did you have to

00:29:03.120 --> 00:29:04.070 line:0%
bring that up?

00:29:04.090 --> 00:29:04.770 line:0%
I...

00:29:05.870 --> 00:29:07.690 line:0%
didn't know.

00:29:19.410 --> 00:29:22.260 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:29:24.440 --> 00:29:26.280 line:0%
Father, your handwriting is truly exceptional.

00:29:26.280 --> 00:29:28.130 line:0%
Can you give me one of your pieces?

00:29:28.130 --> 00:29:29.680 line:0%
Since my arm

00:29:29.930 --> 00:29:32.340 line:0%
was injured years ago,

00:29:32.370 --> 00:29:34.770 line:0%
my brushwork hasn't been as good as before.

00:29:34.840 --> 00:29:36.120 line:0%
I'll give you

00:29:36.140 --> 00:29:37.890 line:0%
a fan I painted earlier.

00:29:58.340 --> 00:29:59.810 line:0%
The strokes are rounded,

00:29:59.890 --> 00:30:01.890 line:0%
and the brushwork is sharp as a sword.

00:30:01.890 --> 00:30:03.980 line:0%
Indeed, they are two different styles.

00:30:03.980 --> 00:30:04.800 line:0%
Could it be

00:30:04.800 --> 00:30:06.800 line:0%
Xing's father was the one who forged

00:30:06.880 --> 00:30:07.680 line:0%
the letter

00:30:08.310 --> 00:30:11.710 line:0%
about my father's treason and collaboration with the enemy?

00:30:31.690 --> 00:30:33.370 line:0%
Why hasn't he come yet?

00:30:48.410 --> 00:30:53.110 line:0%
[Tomb of my beloved wife, Wang Ruohan]

00:30:59.210 --> 00:31:00.190 line:0%
Ghost Face!

00:31:00.310 --> 00:31:01.310 line:0%
Ghost Face.

00:31:02.220 --> 00:31:03.630 line:0%
You're finally here.

00:31:03.740 --> 00:31:05.250 line:0%
You came to see your mother again?

00:31:05.250 --> 00:31:06.500 line:0%
I came to wait for you.

00:31:07.960 --> 00:31:08.760 line:0%
Wait for me?

00:31:15.960 --> 00:31:16.820 line:0%
This is for you.

00:31:19.720 --> 00:31:20.520 line:0%
It's...

00:31:21.280 --> 00:31:22.280 line:0%
I heard of a folk remedy

00:31:22.280 --> 00:31:24.840 line:0%
that can remove birthmarks.

00:31:24.920 --> 00:31:26.080 line:0%
It's said if you rub this

00:31:26.080 --> 00:31:27.840 line:0%
on the birthmark repeatedly,

00:31:27.840 --> 00:31:29.560 line:0%
it can fade and even disappear.

00:31:29.560 --> 00:31:30.530 line:0%
Give it a try.

00:31:42.320 --> 00:31:44.180 line:0%
You came here just to give me this?

00:31:44.990 --> 00:31:46.590 line:0%
What if I hadn't come today?

00:31:46.720 --> 00:31:48.160 line:0%
Then I would come tomorrow.

00:31:48.160 --> 00:31:49.680 line:0%
Anyway, my mother would be very happy

00:31:49.680 --> 00:31:51.080 line:0%
if I visit her more often.

00:31:56.920 --> 00:31:57.800 line:0%
Let me show you.

00:32:01.300 --> 00:32:02.300 line:0%
Give me your hand.

00:32:09.870 --> 00:32:11.150 line:0%
Like this.

00:32:11.480 --> 00:32:14.520 line:0%
Rub it on the birthmark repeatedly.

00:32:15.660 --> 00:32:17.200 line:0%
Don't be too gentle,

00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:19.400 line:0%
and don't use too much strength either.

00:32:31.640 --> 00:32:32.440 line:0%
Understand?

00:33:02.380 --> 00:33:03.340 line:0%
Here.

00:33:04.580 --> 00:33:05.580 line:0%
Take it.

00:33:10.430 --> 00:33:11.340 line:0%
Anyway,

00:33:11.740 --> 00:33:12.970 line:0%
you need to be persistent

00:33:12.970 --> 00:33:14.070 line:0%
for it to work.

00:33:23.840 --> 00:33:26.020 line:0%
We're not related, and we're not friends.

00:33:26.020 --> 00:33:27.040 line:0%
Why

00:33:27.640 --> 00:33:29.900 line:0%
are you giving me something so valuable?

00:33:30.610 --> 00:33:32.110 line:0%
It's not valuable.

00:33:32.200 --> 00:33:33.300 line:0%
I, Lu Chuichui,

00:33:33.400 --> 00:33:35.000 line:0%
have no shortage of gold.

00:33:39.840 --> 00:33:41.920 line:0%
As long as your birthmark can be cured,

00:33:41.920 --> 00:33:42.920 line:0%
and in the future,

00:33:43.040 --> 00:33:44.560 line:0%
you can take off your mask

00:33:44.600 --> 00:33:45.840 line:0%
and face the world

00:33:45.910 --> 00:33:47.580 line:0%
openly and confidently,

00:33:47.860 --> 00:33:48.920 line:0%
that's something no amount

00:33:48.920 --> 00:33:50.040 line:0%
of gold can buy.

00:34:19.030 --> 00:34:19.840 line:0%
Thank you.

00:34:43.950 --> 00:34:45.600 line:0%
My Lord, I'm here to seek justice!

00:34:45.600 --> 00:34:46.720 line:0%
I have something to report.

00:34:46.720 --> 00:34:48.180 line:0%
My Lord, I beg for justice.

00:34:51.030 --> 00:34:53.260 line:0%
This is the first time that someone

00:34:53.570 --> 00:34:55.060 line:0%
seeks justice from me.

00:34:56.189 --> 00:34:57.720 line:0%
What grievance do you have?

00:34:58.870 --> 00:35:01.030 line:0%
[Yun Que]

00:34:59.320 --> 00:35:00.480 line:0%
In the case of Jinxiu Workshop,

00:35:00.480 --> 00:35:02.160 line:0%
many innocent people died.

00:35:02.180 --> 00:35:03.560 line:0%
Please investigate thoroughly, My Lord.

00:35:03.560 --> 00:35:04.650 line:0%
How tedious.

00:35:04.920 --> 00:35:05.720 line:0%
Get lost.

00:35:06.000 --> 00:35:06.840 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:35:06.840 --> 00:35:08.640 line:0%
I heard you're called the White Ghost.

00:35:08.640 --> 00:35:10.280 line:0%
You are a man of integrity who hunts bad people.

00:35:10.280 --> 00:35:12.440 line:0%
Surely you won't ignore the people's grievances.

00:35:12.440 --> 00:35:13.200 line:0%
If you

00:35:13.200 --> 00:35:14.880 line:0%
refuse to clear the name of Jinxiu Workshop,

00:35:14.880 --> 00:35:16.600 line:0%
I'm willing to die to prove my sincerity!

00:35:16.600 --> 00:35:17.630 line:0%
Madwoman!

00:35:17.960 --> 00:35:19.560 line:0%
She's probably an assassin.

00:35:20.280 --> 00:35:21.080 line:0%
My Lord,

00:35:21.120 --> 00:35:22.840 line:0%
please clear the name of Jinxiu Workshop!

00:35:22.840 --> 00:35:23.520 line:0%
Stop!

00:35:30.960 --> 00:35:31.860 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:35:32.240 --> 00:35:33.680 line:0%
what crime has this woman committed

00:35:33.680 --> 00:35:35.120 line:0%
so that you want to burn her on the street?

00:35:35.120 --> 00:35:36.720 line:0%
This is Zhuque Street in Xiang'an,

00:35:36.720 --> 00:35:38.000 line:0%
under the watch of the emperor.

00:35:38.000 --> 00:35:39.400 line:0%
The people are watching.

00:35:39.480 --> 00:35:41.520 line:0%
You don't intend to take a life so carelessly, right?

00:35:41.520 --> 00:35:43.780 line:0%
I merely wanted to deal with an assassin.

00:35:44.280 --> 00:35:46.940 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, do you want to interfere?

00:35:47.040 --> 00:35:48.040 line:0%
Grand Commander?

00:35:48.350 --> 00:35:49.280 line:0%
So you are

00:35:49.280 --> 00:35:50.800 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, the White Ghost.

00:35:50.800 --> 00:35:51.680 line:0%
I am not an assassin.

00:35:51.680 --> 00:35:52.800 line:0%
I came to seek justice!

00:35:52.800 --> 00:35:54.240 line:0%
My Lord, please reinvestigate

00:35:54.240 --> 00:35:56.030 line:0%
the case of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:35:58.680 --> 00:35:59.480 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:36:00.160 --> 00:36:00.920 line:0%
since this woman

00:36:00.920 --> 00:36:02.850 line:0%
said I'm the one she's looking for,

00:36:03.000 --> 00:36:03.920 line:0%
I'll take her with me.

00:36:03.920 --> 00:36:05.630 line:0%
Since you've said so,

00:36:05.920 --> 00:36:08.560 line:0%
this person is yours.

00:36:14.570 --> 00:36:15.590 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:36:15.720 --> 00:36:16.600 line:0%
I have long heard

00:36:16.600 --> 00:36:17.760 line:0%
of your impartiality

00:36:17.760 --> 00:36:18.900 line:0%
and integrity.

00:36:19.080 --> 00:36:20.240 line:0%
My family is in Jiangnan,

00:36:20.240 --> 00:36:22.350 line:0%
supplying the raw material for silk to Jinxiu Workshop.

00:36:22.350 --> 00:36:23.280 line:0%
This is the order book

00:36:23.280 --> 00:36:24.760 line:0%
from Jinxiu Workshop.

00:36:28.440 --> 00:36:29.080 line:0%
This is the order

00:36:29.080 --> 00:36:30.880 line:0%
placed by Princess Runing's consort back then.

00:36:30.880 --> 00:36:32.120 line:0%
Purple chrysanthemums exceeding regulations.

00:36:31.850 --> 00:36:34.270 line:0%
[4,000 taels of silver in total, with 1,325 taels unpaid]

00:36:32.280 --> 00:36:33.560 line:0%
But the paper used for this order

00:36:33.560 --> 00:36:34.840 line:0%
is thinner than usual.

00:36:34.880 --> 00:36:36.080 line:0%
If we can prove that this order

00:36:36.080 --> 00:36:37.160 line:0%
was tampered with,

00:36:37.160 --> 00:36:38.360 line:0%
we can clear the name of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:36:38.360 --> 00:36:39.120 line:0%
Right?

00:36:41.320 --> 00:36:42.440 line:0%
I'll take these.

00:36:42.440 --> 00:36:43.440 line:0%
You go back first.

00:36:43.680 --> 00:36:44.600 line:0%
If needed,

00:36:44.960 --> 00:36:46.360 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau will contact your parents.

00:36:46.360 --> 00:36:47.600 line:0%
But the owners of Jinxiu Workshop

00:36:47.600 --> 00:36:48.280 line:0%
were good people.

00:36:48.280 --> 00:36:49.520 line:0%
They were definitely wronged!

00:36:49.520 --> 00:36:50.240 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:36:51.290 --> 00:36:52.750 line:0%
Escort her out of the city.

00:37:15.990 --> 00:37:17.220 line:0%
Help!

00:37:36.840 --> 00:37:37.480 line:0%
Hero,

00:37:37.480 --> 00:37:38.120 line:0%
go catch the bad guy now!

00:37:38.120 --> 00:37:39.320 line:0%
Don't let him escape!

00:37:40.880 --> 00:37:42.340 line:0%
He's already run far away.

00:37:43.520 --> 00:37:44.720 line:0%
Miss, are you alright?

00:37:44.720 --> 00:37:45.840 line:0%
Don't worry about me.

00:37:45.840 --> 00:37:47.400 line:0%
You should go after him first.

00:37:47.400 --> 00:37:48.120 line:0%
That person must have something to do

00:37:48.120 --> 00:37:49.200 line:0%
with the case of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:37:49.200 --> 00:37:51.930 line:0%
Otherwise, he wouldn't have tried to silence me.

00:38:02.720 --> 00:38:03.520 line:0%
Xu.

00:38:05.540 --> 00:38:06.360 line:0%
Xing.

00:38:10.280 --> 00:38:11.280 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:38:13.040 --> 00:38:13.840 line:0%
Miss Yun Que

00:38:13.840 --> 00:38:15.240 line:0%
was attacked at the inn last night.

00:38:15.240 --> 00:38:16.960 line:0%
If I hadn't been patrolling nearby,

00:38:16.960 --> 00:38:18.240 line:0%
she would have been killed.

00:38:18.240 --> 00:38:19.000 line:0%
Is this how the Imperial Security Bureau

00:38:19.000 --> 00:38:20.560 line:0%
protects witnesses?

00:38:23.760 --> 00:38:26.090 line:0%
I did escort her out of the city yesterday.

00:38:26.180 --> 00:38:27.800 line:0%
How did she sneak back...

00:38:29.190 --> 00:38:30.190 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:38:30.240 --> 00:38:31.320 line:0%
I almost never got to

00:38:31.320 --> 00:38:32.720 line:0%
see you again.

00:38:32.720 --> 00:38:33.520 line:0%
That man in black

00:38:33.520 --> 00:38:34.960 line:0%
surely wanted to silence me,

00:38:34.960 --> 00:38:35.960 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:38:36.440 --> 00:38:38.080 line:0%
You took my evidence,

00:38:38.240 --> 00:38:39.880 line:0%
so you have to be responsible for me.

00:38:39.880 --> 00:38:41.200 line:0%
That order from Jinxiu Workshop

00:38:41.200 --> 00:38:42.360 line:0%
is the key evidence to clear the name

00:38:42.360 --> 00:38:43.440 line:0%
of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:38:43.440 --> 00:38:44.800 line:0%
I am a key witness.

00:38:44.960 --> 00:38:46.360 line:0%
You can't just ignore me.

00:38:47.680 --> 00:38:49.160 line:0%
I told you yesterday

00:38:49.450 --> 00:38:50.710 line:0%
we can't clear the name

00:38:50.720 --> 00:38:51.600 line:0%
of Jinxiu Workshop

00:38:51.600 --> 00:38:52.360 line:0%
solely based on the order

00:38:52.360 --> 00:38:53.480 line:0%
from six years ago.

00:38:53.880 --> 00:38:56.040 line:0%
You caused a scene on the street of Xiang'an City,

00:38:56.040 --> 00:38:57.200 line:0%
as if you wanted everyone in the world

00:38:57.200 --> 00:38:58.920 line:0%
to know you're involved in this case.

00:38:58.920 --> 00:39:00.000 line:0%
Do you think this is

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:01.560 line:0%
exciting and fun?

00:39:02.320 --> 00:39:03.380 line:0%
Do you have any idea

00:39:03.560 --> 00:39:06.280 line:0%
how complicated this case is and how many people are involved?

00:39:06.280 --> 00:39:07.910 line:0%
Last night, it was an assassin.

00:39:07.910 --> 00:39:09.120 line:0%
Tomorrow, it could bring death

00:39:09.120 --> 00:39:10.920 line:0%
and destruction to your family.

00:39:15.440 --> 00:39:16.240 line:0%
You're so caught up

00:39:16.240 --> 00:39:18.300 line:0%
in your passion for solving the case.

00:39:18.320 --> 00:39:19.840 line:0%
What about your family?

00:39:22.600 --> 00:39:24.320 line:0%
I didn't think that far ahead.

00:39:24.560 --> 00:39:25.840 line:0%
I was wrong.

00:39:25.860 --> 00:39:27.000 line:0%
Given the situation,

00:39:27.000 --> 00:39:27.800 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau

00:39:27.800 --> 00:39:29.660 line:0%
will send more men to protect you.

00:39:30.040 --> 00:39:31.170 line:0%
As for your parents,

00:39:31.360 --> 00:39:33.220 line:0%
I'll send people to protect them.

00:39:35.480 --> 00:39:37.640 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau will investigate the case.

00:39:37.640 --> 00:39:39.440 line:0%
Before the truth comes to light,

00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:41.870 line:0%
you must not act rashly again.

00:39:42.030 --> 00:39:43.210 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander.

00:39:43.210 --> 00:39:44.970 line:0%
I knew you wouldn't ignore me.

00:39:57.560 --> 00:39:58.360 line:0%
You have Jinxiu Workshop's order

00:39:58.360 --> 00:39:59.600 line:0%
from six years ago.

00:39:59.600 --> 00:40:00.640 line:0%
Then what's your relationship

00:40:00.640 --> 00:40:01.900 line:0%
with Jinxiu Workshop?

00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:05.400 line:0%
Didn't you hear

00:40:05.400 --> 00:40:06.560 line:0%
what I just said?

00:40:06.560 --> 00:40:07.880 line:0%
I'm just curious.

00:40:09.560 --> 00:40:10.480 line:0%
Who are you?

00:40:10.600 --> 00:40:12.160 line:0%
The evidence is for Grand Commander.

00:40:12.160 --> 00:40:13.550 line:0%
Why should I tell you?

00:40:14.760 --> 00:40:17.620 line:0%
Don't be disrespectful to Grand Commander's wife.

00:40:21.600 --> 00:40:22.480 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:40:22.480 --> 00:40:23.160 line:0%
you...

00:40:23.160 --> 00:40:24.480 line:0%
you got married?

00:40:27.680 --> 00:40:28.440 line:0%
But the rumor says

00:40:28.440 --> 00:40:28.920 line:0%
any woman

00:40:28.920 --> 00:40:29.960 line:0%
who wants to marry Grand Commander

00:40:29.960 --> 00:40:32.020 line:0%
would die an unnatural death, right?

00:40:33.680 --> 00:40:34.760 line:0%
How could this be?

00:40:35.720 --> 00:40:37.120 line:0%
I always thought

00:40:37.140 --> 00:40:37.920 line:0%
somehow,

00:40:37.920 --> 00:40:40.850 line:0%
Grand Commander had been waiting for me to marry him.

00:40:41.770 --> 00:40:42.960 line:0%
So all these years,

00:40:42.960 --> 00:40:44.360 line:0%
I've been learning

00:40:44.360 --> 00:40:46.160 line:0%
to manage household affairs,

00:40:46.160 --> 00:40:48.000 line:0%
to be a proper wife,

00:40:48.000 --> 00:40:50.400 line:0%
to cook, to keep accounts, and to make beds.

00:40:56.280 --> 00:40:57.160 line:0%
I even dreamed

00:40:57.160 --> 00:40:58.820 line:0%
of marrying Grand Commander.

00:41:05.320 --> 00:41:07.000 line:0%
You... You must be crazy.

00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:07.480 line:0%
Madam,

00:41:07.480 --> 00:41:08.920 line:0%
this has nothing to do with us.

00:41:08.920 --> 00:41:09.560 line:0%
This...

00:41:09.580 --> 00:41:10.520 line:0%
This woman

00:41:10.520 --> 00:41:12.240 line:0%
was standing in the way and crying for justice.

00:41:12.240 --> 00:41:12.920 line:0%
That's why Grand Commander

00:41:12.920 --> 00:41:13.920 line:0%
brought her back.

00:41:13.960 --> 00:41:15.640 line:0%
Why would I misunderstand?

00:41:15.960 --> 00:41:17.400 line:0%
There are a lot of women

00:41:17.400 --> 00:41:18.040 line:0%
in Xiang'an

00:41:18.040 --> 00:41:20.080 line:0%
who admire Grand Commander.

00:41:20.120 --> 00:41:21.280 line:0%
It's normal.

00:41:21.320 --> 00:41:22.120 line:0%
Besides,

00:41:22.120 --> 00:41:23.320 line:0%
we are...

00:41:29.080 --> 00:41:31.160 line:0%
If you have already found someone you like,

00:41:31.160 --> 00:41:32.320 line:0%
that's a good thing.

00:41:37.760 --> 00:41:40.090 line:0%
It seems you've already made up your mind.

00:41:44.640 --> 00:41:45.440 line:0%
Then...

00:41:48.200 --> 00:41:50.130 line:0%
what do you plan to do in the future?

00:41:50.740 --> 00:41:52.240 line:0%
In Chen Shoujie's mansion,

00:41:52.240 --> 00:41:52.880 line:0%
I only found

00:41:52.880 --> 00:41:54.880 line:0%
a piece of fabric from Jinxiu Workshop.

00:41:54.880 --> 00:41:56.520 line:0%
I still need to confirm

00:41:56.680 --> 00:41:58.360 line:0%
which year's pattern it is.

